Error [E0914]: unknown interpolation selector `#Repr`
  --> tests/ui/debug_unknown_selector.jet:3:15
    |
  3 |     print("{x#Repr}")
    |               ^^^^
 Why: string interpolation supports a closed selector set — use `#Debug` or `#Fixed(n)`
 Fix: write `{value#Debug}` for debug output, `{value#Fixed(2)}` for two decimal places, or `{value}` for display
